  - getdist architectural INPUT parsing (LUNITS/UNITMODE, not LUPREC).
  - DIESEL edtime formatter for DATE/CDATE/TDCREATE/TDUPDATE (menucmd is
    still a stub) — the sysvars are readable but no edtime consumer.
  - vports/setview remain headless stubs (single-viewport sentinel /
    nil); a live viewport model needs a CAD host.
